item.description:
After complaining about getting an erroneous strike from YouTube, we check in on Matan Even interviewing Hunter Biden. I don’t know why Hunter is on this media tour. It would be better if he was still a crackhead.&nbsp;

Aaron Imholte had a self-proclaimed crash out as the pressure of pretending to be a successful streamer is getting to him. It’s so embarrassing that he had to go on his show the next morning and cope. Brendan Schaub has created the most self-indulgent video series ever. After calling out Kim Kardashian for her new reality show about parents who are too passionate about little league baseball, Brendan released a multi-part series about coaching his son’s peewee football team. We cover the web series and all of the hypocrisy. Kevin Brennan was given all of Adam Busch’s paystubs because that’s what he demanded in order to have Adam on the show. Turns out, it was never about the paystubs. KB just needed an excuse to not face Adam. What an absolute pussy. Jerry Banfield had the best night so far this year at the strip club. He got taken for over $2,000 but he doesn’t have a single regret, even though he received zero sexual gratification. But who would want that at a strip club? Opie and Ron are answering back to Anthony Cumia’s DM. They aren’t sure which angle to take. Are they better than Anthony? Is Ron funnier than Jim Norton? Or is it pathetic that Anthony is paying any attention to Opie’s cohost who is practically homeless? We finish up with a round of “Opie or Burr?” and your voicemails.&nbsp;

WATP candy available now:&nbsp;https://www.leiselandfriendsgourmet.com/

Support us, get bonus episodes, and watch live every Saturday and Wednesday:

