item.description:
This week we’re checking in on an influencer named Stas who does a podcast with her ugly friend Vic. Stas happens to be BFFs with Kylie Jenner and when the three of them get together it’s a whole lot of stupid. Kylie is possibly the worst cat owner in the world.&nbsp;
Vinnie Paulino joins the show to watch KarmicX sing a Ween song he doesn’t know for the Cringe of the Week segment. We have the bodycam footage from Stuttering John’s house back in April. He called the cops when a DoorDasher rang the doorbell too many times. ShizoSean joins the show to tell us about banging Mersh’s ex-girlfriend IceDanc3r and his exploits at Steel Toe’s anniversary show, Chrissie Mayr’s content hotel, and Vito Gesualdi’s house. We watch a new DVD comedy special of Artie Fletcher from 2004. His set at Coconuts in St. Pete Beach reminds Vinnie of the worst time in his life. Jerry Banfield is doing a victory lap because his business made almost $400 in one day. He’s literally rubbing it in the faces of the haters while explaining that he’s taking cash advances from credit cards to pay his rent. Opie has a big FU Friday with all three of his friends. Erik Marino is somehow the least funny try-hard on a show that includes Ron the Waiter. Trump renaming Lake Ontario has broken his brain so he only has one joke the entire stream. Tony P. seems to be losing his patience with these idiots. We finish up with Internet News and your voicemails.&nbsp;
WATP candy available now:&nbsp;https://www.leiselandfriendsgourmet.com/
