item.description:
I’m joined by Jenny Jingles and Producer Chris to get caught up on Jerry Banfield. He just release three vlogs and it’s a wild ride. It’s officially over with “the queen” (the one that got away). Jerry acts like he’s over it but he’s not. No worries, he’s getting tons of dates and she should be jealous (he hopes). Also, he has decided once again to completely change his business model.&nbsp;

