item.description:
This week we’re checking in on Kyle Mooney and Beck Bennett, two SNL alums who are maybe the most forgettable cast members ever. Kyle Mooney is especially terrible and he proves it on this podcast that relies on schtick and nonsense.&nbsp;

Trucker Andy joins us to discuss where on the doll Kyle touched him. Jerry Banfield has once again fallen in love. Oh no. I have a feeling this won’t end well. Jerry is once again falling in love immediately. If this woman watches this stream she is going to file a restraining order. Anthony Cumia went on Quadfather’s show, BYB Podcast. Even though Ava was on, Ant did a great job of explaining why Chad Zumock will definitely steal the money he was given for his GoFundMe. Opie had another F U Friday with Ron and Tony. Opie is getting more confident with these zilches. He’s trying out material. Somehow, he’s still the least funny guy. We finish with Internet News and your voicemails.&nbsp;

WATP candy available now: https://www.leiselandfriendsgourmet.com/

Trucker Andy’s channel: https://www.youtube.com/@StaySorry&nbsp;

